{
  "name": "Block Missile",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Use this skill when you make an [Evasion Check] against an attack from outside of close range. Add +2 to the result of the check. No effect can reduce the result of this check or the number of dice rolled for it.</p>\n<p>(Hate Top): You may also use this skill making a [Resistance Check].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A skill that blocks incoming arrows by holding a shield in front of the body. If it attacks from the front, it is possible to repel even magic.</p>",
